OL,3,GNEWSALifting bridge to shut for week
OL,4,Afor repairs
OL,5,
OL,6,FA lifting bridge is set to be closed to
OL,7,Ftraffic and pedestrians for a week
OL,8,Fwhile planned repair work is carried
OL,9,Fout.
OL,11,FTwin Sails Bridge, which crosses Holes
OL,12,FBay and links Poole and Hamworthy in
OL,13,FDorset, needs repairs to its lifting
OL,14,Fmechanism.
OL,16,FIt is set to shut from 30 November
OL,17,Funtil 6 December, with drivers and
OL,18,Fpedestrians urged to plan their routes
OL,19,Fand allow extra time for their journey.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
