OL,3,GNEWSALifting bridge to shut for week
OL,4,Afor repairs
OL,5,
OL,6,FAll traffic will be diverted via Poole
OL,7,FLifting Bridge, using West Street and
OL,8,FBlandford Road. Rigler Road on the
OL,9,Fwestern side of the bridge will remain
OL,10,Fopen but only be accessible from
OL,11,FBlandford Road on the Hamworthy side
